    ]
  }
}]]></Value>
    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[Stoolball is a sport run by volunteers, and whether it's making the tea once a year at your local tournament, or working as a trained stoolball coach in local schools, there's an opportunity for you to get involved.]]></Value>
    </description>
